@@ -28,6 +41,16 @@ to the shared UI domain model. Sync owns transcript membership and store writes.
 
 ## Decisions
 
+### Why live BTW copies instruction entries separately
+
+OpenCode stores API-managed instruction entries outside its message transcript.
+Copying messages alone changes the system prefix when the parent has such entries.
+The live request probe checks the complete serialized prefix with a custom instruction entry.
+The coordinator also captures the actual system baseline of the main model request.
+It applies that captured baseline to the side model request after an instruction entry changes.
+Live creation waits for a captured baseline after plugin installation.
+Ordinary BTW retains its native fallback on hosts without the optional plugin.
+
 ### Why fresh provider reads wait for post-call requests
 
 Provider, model and default-model reads share one catalog promise per directory
