 ## Ownership map
 
+Live BTW keeps one logical root session and stores the current native transcript ID in its metadata.
+`lib/liveBtw.ts` admits snapshots prepared through the adapter and the BTW coordinator plugin.
+The coordinator publishes the head only after the adapter imports and materializes the snapshot.
