+The live composer keeps drafts on the logical root while its execution transcript changes.
+Selection insertion addresses the column mailbox, which uses the live root or the ordinary session ID.
+Undo restores text, attachments and context to that root on every runtime.
+The native revert and its rollback still address the execution transcript.
+Consumed context returns only after a failed send.
+Live imports persist their native transcript order in message metadata.
