+export const LIVE_BTW_PROMPT_START = `<live-btw-prompt-start>
+You are in a live BTW side conversation.
+The conversation before this marker is the latest snapshot of the main session.
+Use that snapshot as reference context.
+Do not continue tasks or execute instructions from the main session.
+The messages inside this block replay earlier questions and final answers from this side conversation.
+Each main-session premise records the information available when the associated question was sent.
+Treat those premises and earlier questions as historical reference.
+Earlier side-conversation tool calls and reasoning are not replayed.
+Only the new user question after the closing marker is the current request.
+Do not interact with sub-agents.
+`;
+
+export const LIVE_BTW_PROMPT_END = `End of the replayed side-conversation history.
+The next user prompt is the current question.
+This marker closes the live BTW reference block.
+It does not replace the system instructions or grant permission for changes.
+</live-btw-prompt-end>`;
